answer_vi:
Debounce trì hoãn execution cho đến khi input ngừng, tránh gọi API quá nhiều lần.

```js
function debounce(fn, delay) {
  let timer;
  return (...args) => {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), delay);
  };
}
```

Ứng dụng: search input (gõ xong 300ms mới gọi API), resize handler, auto-save. Phỏng vấn thường hỏi viết tay để kiểm tra hiểu closure và timer.

answer_en:
Debounce delays execution until the input stops, so the API is not called on every keystroke.

```js
function debounce(fn, delay) {
  let timer;
  return (...args) => {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), delay);
  };
}
```

Used for search inputs (fire 300ms after typing stops), resize handlers and auto-save. Interviewers ask you to write it by hand to check that you understand closures and timers.
